  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Redness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Niacinamide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is:</strong> <span style=\"background-color: var(--palette-white, #ffffff);\">A hydrating priming serum with a facial roller to sculpt your face and leave a healthy, radiant glow.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Normal, Oily, Dry, and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Concerns: </strong>Dryness and Redness</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Niacinamide: Helps to visibly brighten skin and reduce the appearance of redness and blemishes.</p><p>- Glycerin: Helps to leave the skin feeling hydrated.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-For best results, apply after moisturizing and before applying makeup. <br>-Gently squeeze the tube so the formula comes out onto the roller applicator. <br>-Massage the roller over the skin, working outward toward the edges of the face.<br>-For hygiene reasons, REFY recommends wiping the roller after every use. <br>-For best results, store the product at room temperature and do not refrigerate. <br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Remove the roller head. <br>-Cut along the top of the tube and rinse to ensure there is no product left. <br>-The tube and lid can both be recycled in your home recycling bin. <br>-The roller is made of PE and TPE and should be recyclable at your local recycling bank.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Redness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Niacinamide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is:</strong> <span style=\"background-color: var(--palette-white, #ffffff);\">A hydrating priming serum with a facial roller to sculpt your face and leave a healthy, radiant glow.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Normal, Oily, Dry, and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Concerns: </strong>Dryness and Redness</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Niacinamide: Helps to visibly brighten skin and reduce the appearance of redness and blemishes.</p><p>- Glycerin: Helps to leave the skin feeling hydrated.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-For best results, apply after moisturizing and before applying makeup. <br>-Gently squeeze the tube so the formula comes out onto the roller applicator. <br>-Massage the roller over the skin, working outward toward the edges of the face.<br>-For hygiene reasons, REFY recommends wiping the roller after every use. <br>-For best results, store the product at room temperature and do not refrigerate. <br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Remove the roller head. <br>-Cut along the top of the tube and rinse to ensure there is no product left. <br>-The tube and lid can both be recycled in your home recycling bin. <br>-The roller is made of PE and TPE and should be recyclable at your local recycling bank.</div></details>",
